<title>HONG KONG: Trading of Peace Hill shares suspended.</title>
<headline>Trading of Peace Hill shares suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of Peace Hill Enterprise Group Ltd was suspended at the company's request pending an announcement, the Hong Kong stock exchange said on Thursday.</p>
